  m_text: "This system is a pilot-scale distillation column used to demonstrate how
    liquid mixtures are separated based on differences in volatility. The setup includes
    a transparent vertical column, reboiler, condenser, pumps, and a full set of
    sensors for monitoring temperature, pressure, and flow throughout the process.
    Students use this equipment to study real industrial separation behavior, observe
    vapor\u2013liquid interactions inside the column, and learn how operating conditions\u2014such
    as reflux ratio and heating rate\u2014affect the efficiency of a distillation
    process.\n\nPress the Button again in order to exit. "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
