      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "This pilot-scale packed column is used to study gas\u2013liquid mass transfer.
    Liquid flows downward through internal packing while air is pushed upward from
    the base, creating a counter-current contact zone. Students use this system to
    investigate absorption, stripping, and mass-transfer efficiency by controlling
    flow rates, logging pressure changes, and observing operating limits such as
    flooding. The column, feed tanks, pumps, and safety platform together create
    a realistic industrial setup for hands-on learning. \n\nPress the Button again
    in order to exit. "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
