      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'This pilot-scale process system is a modular training rig used to demonstrate
    the fundamentals of industrial chemical operations. It includes multiple small
    vessels, columns, pumps, and interconnected piping arranged to simulate real
    plant layouts. Students use this system to explore fluid handling, tank operation,
    process flow, and equipment integration on a safe, scaled-down platform. The
    setup provides hands-on experience with core unit operations and helps visualize
    how industrial processes move and transform materials.


    Press the Button
    again in order to exit. '
